================================================================================
Claude Code Agent Log — Dynamic Role Switching with Tools & Action Continuation
Date: 2026-03-09
================================================================================

## Plan Summary
Implemented 3 interrelated features across two systems:
1. Dynamic Role Assignment — meta LLM call every N steps assigns roles (eater/cleaner)
2. Role-Specific Prompts + Tool Actions — differentiated prompts per role, tool actions
3. Action Continuation — reminders to continue multi-step move_to/clean_at/eat_at actions

